Perform a read-only diagnostic of the live Nova runtime.
Do not access customer, billing, Salesforce, Maxio, Gmail, Zoom, Rescue, or other customer-facing data.
Do not modify, deploy, restart, authenticate, or change any resource.
Report only:
1. whether this request reached the live Command Center successfully;
2. runtime mode and host/service identity if available;
3. deployed source commit/SHA if available;
4. active agent roster and configured provider for Taylor, Jamie, and Alex;
5. whether Codex CLI is installed, its version if available, and whether Taylor's Codex login reports authenticated, without returning any credential material;
6. whether the runtime appears to be using Codex CLI or the GitHub/ChatGPT reasoning relay.
Return a concise diagnostic. Do not include secret values, tokens, auth files, environment variable values, customer information, ticket contents, or external platform data.
